\"\n- **Invoice:** INV-49589, due 2026-11-04\n- **Amount:** $6,074.98, the full invoice amount\n\nBefore paying, I checked the payment list and it was empty, so this invoice hadn't already been paid. The amount is under the $10,000 limit, so it didn't need controller approval. I also attached a duplicate-protection key so the payment can't go through twice.\n\nI didn't touch Delta Printworks's other two invoices. INV-39581 ($4,040.99) is still a draft waiting for approval, and INV-42976 was already paid.", "type": "text"}]}]}